      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When arranging car transportation in Ancharakandy, meticulous preparation of documentation is essential to ensure a smooth, compliant, and insured transit process. The transport provider will require a bundle of paperwork that verifies ownership, legal compliance, and insurance coverage.</p>
<p>Missing or incomplete documents can lead to delays, fines, or even seizure of the vehicle at the port. Below is a concise guide to the mandatory paperwork and the critical insurance component that protects your vehicle throughout its maritime journey.</p>
<h3>Essential Documentation Checklist</h3>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The registration certificate (RC) must be photocopied, self‑attested, and submitted. This proves legal ownership and the vehicle’s identity.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, valid at the time of loading, confirms the vehicle meets environmental standards. An expired PUC can halt the export process.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The policy must cover the vehicle for the duration of the voyage and comply with the International Maritime Organization (IMO) guidelines. It should state the policy number, coverage limits, and expiry date.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Inland Bill of Lading (Bilty) issued by the Indian Bureau of Shipping (IBA) serves as the official receipt and transport contract. It details the cargo, consignor, consignee, and terms of carriage.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>In addition to these documents, a <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> is highly recommended. This insurance covers the full market value of the vehicle, offering comprehensive protection against loss, damage, theft, or unforeseen events during sea transit.</p>
<p>By declaring the vehicle’s value, you eliminate ambiguity in claims processing and ensure that any compensation is equivalent to the vehicle’s actual worth. Marine transit insurance also satisfies customs and port authorities, who often require proof of coverage before allowing the cargo to depart.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


